msgstr "某个 Character 现在或曾经在敌对的 Corporation 或 Alliance 中。"

#: markers.py:55
msgid "A character joined many Corporations within the last 365 days."
msgstr "某个 Character 在过去 365 天内加入了许多 Corporation。"

